{"id": "EUVD-2026-97651", "enisaUuid": "7de0e94c-9f23-3f41-a334-00f8738b9174", "description": "gitoxide gix-pack before 0.75.0 contains a reachable assertion in BytesToEntriesIter::new_from_header: the pack header decoder accepts version 3, but a release-enabled assert_eq! requires version 2. A malicious remote can send a 12-byte pack header declaring version 3 to panic the client and abort the clone or fetch.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:53:40", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/GitoxideLabs/gitoxide/security/advisories/GHSA-633h-mqjc-8rwg", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gix-pack-before-0.75.0-reachable-assertion-dos-via-pack-version-3-header"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109349", "GHSA-wmw6-cp8f-c6q8"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "09e82dce-47be-338e-b535-3ac16151ca69", "product": {"name": "gix-pack", "vendor": {"name": "GitoxideLabs"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.75.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fef9bffc-5141-3ab2-b20f-ef923a64b48e", "vendor": {"name": "GitoxideLabs"}}], "isExploited": false}